# Keep the SkyPilot workdir upload small: eval jobs need only the Python source,
# configs, and instruction JSONs. The PyRep/RLBench forks are already installed
# inside the eval image (/opt/src/PyRep2, /opt/src/RLBench2), and datasets and
# checkpoints come from S3 at runtime.
.git
PyRep
RLBench
data
logs
train_logs
eval_logs
debug_videos
results
paper
plots
.venv
*.rrd
*.pth
*.zip
*.out
__pycache__
*.egg-info
